{"action_id":null,"arguments":[],"assumptions":[{"assumption_id":"node.e161e5517b4d4cbf89c7546b.a0","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The selected control is assessed for one identified benefit offer by a distributor to a client in the SFC-authorised-fund setting.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.e161e5517b4d4cbf89c7546b.a1","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"A direct promotional nexus may arise from express promotion or eligibility terms; it need not require a completed investment.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.e161e5517b4d4cbf89c7546b.a2","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"Gift and discount classifications are supplied judgments, not inferred merely from the label 'additional return'.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.e161e5517b4d4cbf89c7546b.a3","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The result means the offer is flagged by this selected gift-control reading; it is not a determination of legal liability or overall compliance.","status":"PROVISIONAL"}],"bundle_hash":"15472d3c01402a98a3fa2a609448678225c2640c4549fe2d091e8127ee6aa7e1","candidate_id":"candidate.6f187120d7854e10984f192768f02b1c","controlled_language":"Read 'in promoting' as requiring a direct connection between the gift offer and promotion of a specified product or product type. The final sentence prevents avoidance through promotion of a fund category or fund house instead of a named fund, while retaining that direct connection. A qualifying fee discount remains excepted.","disposition_reason":"Unreviewed interpretation proposal","family_ids":["scope"],"generation_phase":"BLIND_INITIAL","issue_ids":["issue.f9b5b84649444894916c9b1d83c3b5e6","issue.7b4b8235c3b446a7b6be31e046331c2c","issue.3c64121f70394660b44d3d2da460b0cd","issue.1f09c9d7209f4245a346b352b4aea22f"],"parent_id":null,"probability_of_legal_correctness":null,"revision_reason":"Requires a direct promotional nexus. Consider an account-opening gift available regardless of investment choice, presented prominently alongside a campaign devoted to funds from one fund house, but with no express statement or eligibility term connecting the gift to those funds. If the presentation creates a contextual association but no direct nexus, this reading does not flag it; R2 does. Mere proximity without a meaningful association satisfies neither reading.","run_id":"run.43cfe1f6c26f47b89fa28eb53ba97027","scheduling_priority":0,"schema_version":"interpretation.v1","score_purpose":"INVESTIGATION_PRIORITY_ONLY","source_packet_hash":"7b78bffd5267abb04c58ab204d1e34f621dc3fb03008be1b35980abcaa535ba4","source_unit_ids":["u1","u13","u14"],"status":"ACTIVE","subject_unit":"Selected paragraph-10 gift-promotion control: direct product connection"}